# Architecture Decision Records

When a choice is expensive to reverse (language, datastore, ID format, module split, feed fan-out, auth scheme, cloud region), add `docs/decisions/NNNN-kebab-title.md`.

- Next number after the highest existing `NNNN`.
- Status: `Proposed` | `Accepted` | `Superseded by NNNN` | `Deprecated`.
- Required sections: Status, Date, Context, Decision, Consequences, Alternatives considered.
- Link the ADR from the feature plan that depends on it.
- Do not ADR a local rename or a library bump. Do not bury a new decision only in chat or a PR description.

Seeded ADRs: 0001 Go, 0002 Next.js, 0003 Postgres+Redis, 0004 modular monolith, 0005 monorepo, 0006 Snowflake IDs, 0007 Tailwind CSS.
